WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 17]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:05.310 --> 02:07.290
Come, my friend.

02:07.870 --> 02:08.820
Have some water.

02:12.430 --> 02:15.890
You said you saw the Japanese

02:15.960 --> 02:17.060
with the Zhainiangniang,

02:17.630 --> 02:18.850
and they could communicate with it?

02:25.360 --> 02:27.610
The mountain deity is a monster.

02:28.400 --> 02:30.130
It was tamed by the Japanese.

02:32.440 --> 02:33.010
Tiezui.

02:37.600 --> 02:38.010
Master Zhang.

02:41.960 --> 02:42.780
Laogou's whistle?

02:43.400 --> 02:44.690
The Japanese kidnapped him

02:45.400 --> 02:46.820
to tame Zhainiangniang.

02:47.790 --> 02:49.840
The underground river cannot access the depths of the Xumi Realm.

02:50.750 --> 02:51.890
It's even riddled with miasma.

02:53.030 --> 02:55.690
The Japanese can only go there with the help of Zhainiangniang.

02:57.280 --> 02:59.060
According to the murals,

02:59.630 --> 03:02.260
there are two ways to enter the Xumi Realm.

03:02.710 --> 03:03.260
One.

03:03.750 --> 03:05.340
Zhainiangniang can carry you inside.

03:07.430 --> 03:08.850
But it has now been killed by you.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.730
And two.

03:11.000 --> 03:12.690
Take the Lifeswapping Herb.

03:13.430 --> 03:14.570
But that's poisonous.

03:14.870 --> 03:16.850
You need the golden pot to cure the poison.

03:17.360 --> 03:18.170
Here's the problem.

03:19.190 --> 03:21.500
We don't have the golden pot.

03:25.630 --> 03:27.060
Oh, Laogou.

03:27.470 --> 03:29.170
If you could tame Zhainiangniang,

03:29.680 --> 03:30.570
why didn't you ask it

03:30.590 --> 03:32.410
to kill all the Japanese?

03:32.750 --> 03:33.290
Eighth Master.

03:33.630 --> 03:34.980
Zhainiangniang is not a dog.

03:35.240 --> 03:36.340
It's not that docile.

03:36.910 --> 03:37.850
I bet

03:38.710 --> 03:40.100
Eighth Master is in grave danger as well.

03:40.590 --> 03:42.540
You don't know Laogou well enough.

03:43.080 --> 03:45.010
He's as slippery as an eel.

03:45.430 --> 03:47.660
He'll keep himself safe.

03:51.680 --> 03:52.130
Master Zhang.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.730
What do we do next?

03:56.030 --> 03:57.850
Let's investigate the edges of the Xumi Realm

03:59.000 --> 04:00.380
and find a way in.

04:04.000 --> 04:04.540
My friend,

04:05.030 --> 04:05.890
let's continue.

04:07.590 --> 04:08.660
You mentioned

04:09.030 --> 04:11.730
Japanese soldiers who came back from the dead.

04:12.400 --> 04:13.220
What did you mean by that?

04:59.720 --> 05:01.370
The mountain deity punished us.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.140
We were all killed.

05:03.920 --> 05:04.900
You mean

05:05.310 --> 05:07.020
the Japanese went in the direction of the flare?

05:11.870 --> 05:14.340
That must be the hideout of Yoshiyuki Hatoyama and his unit.

05:17.490 --> 05:18.790
You said

05:18.950 --> 05:20.340
they came back from the dead,

05:20.680 --> 05:22.100
and they killed all of you?

05:24.720 --> 05:26.250
If they were this powerful,

05:27.920 --> 05:29.930
they should come out and kill us now.

05:30.310 --> 05:31.220
Why are they hiding instead?

05:32.720 --> 05:35.660
Could it be that Hatoyama is testing another spell?

05:44.720 --> 05:45.700
The golden pot.

05:48.120 --> 05:49.900
The golden pot you saw on the mural

05:51.070 --> 05:53.410
must be the pot Hatoyama used to place his spell.

05:55.270 --> 05:56.600
When I was interrogating Ding Qiansui,

05:56.600 --> 05:57.580
he kept saying

05:58.240 --> 06:00.220
that Hatoyama had mastered everything

06:00.510 --> 06:01.460
in the Otherworld Tower.

06:02.360 --> 06:03.540
The golden pot

06:05.270 --> 06:07.250
must contain the secret of the Otherworld Tower.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.050
Fate is cruel.

06:17.360 --> 06:18.250
If I had known this would happen,

06:19.000 --> 06:19.410
I would have

06:20.310 --> 06:21.580
told you everything

06:21.680 --> 06:23.020
about Wu Laogou.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.250
Master Zhang.

06:31.000 --> 06:33.340
Master Zhang, please bury us.

06:34.000 --> 06:36.780
We have carried out the purpose of our lives.

06:37.480 --> 06:39.100
You have achieved far more than what ordinary folk ever will.

06:39.510 --> 06:41.460
But we misplaced our belief,

06:42.000 --> 06:43.050
and so, we ended up hurting people.

06:47.070 --> 06:48.140
To some, fire

06:49.750 --> 06:50.660
can bring light.

06:52.310 --> 06:53.370
But it can also burn.

06:59.630 --> 07:02.100
All of you are formidable warriors.

07:02.750 --> 07:04.100
Thank you.

07:05.040 --> 07:06.170
All of you are heroes as well.

07:11.680 --> 07:12.850
What else can I do for you?

07:16.480 --> 07:19.220
I want to listen to the story of Wu Laogou.

07:21.070 --> 07:24.170
Then, I'll tell Ma Jinbao his story in the afterlife.

07:30.800 --> 07:33.900
Back then, there was a famine in Changsha. People were displaced.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.810
They banded together to steal food.

07:38.430 --> 07:40.490
Fifth Master was among them.

07:57.160 --> 07:57.700
Mister.

08:03.680 --> 08:05.340
Brother, I know him.

08:05.560 --> 08:06.660
He's a hooligan in the city

08:06.830 --> 08:08.140
who takes advantage of people like us.

08:08.480 --> 08:10.340
Sir, spare me some food, please.

08:10.430 --> 08:12.020
Miscreant! How dare you steal our belongings?

08:12.240 --> 08:13.020
Kill him.

08:17.600 --> 08:18.410
Brother.

08:19.310 --> 08:21.050
Stop. He'll die.

08:21.360 --> 08:21.850
Move aside.

08:56.840 --> 08:57.340
Let's go.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.060
Little boy.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.100
Who abandoned you here?

09:34.910 --> 09:35.890
I'll raise you from now on.

09:36.510 --> 09:38.820
You shall be Xiaozhu.

09:40.000 --> 09:41.060
The name sounds tough.

09:41.670 --> 09:42.650
I hope you'll be

09:43.240 --> 09:44.530
a tough guy like me.

09:47.840 --> 09:48.340
Who's there?

09:52.150 --> 09:52.890
What are you doing here?

09:53.670 --> 09:54.730
You want more beating?

09:59.720 --> 10:00.420
You can have this.

10:02.600 --> 10:03.730
I don't like to be indebted to anyone.

10:06.270 --> 10:07.370
If you don't save yourself,

10:07.910 --> 10:08.850
no one else will save you.

10:09.480 --> 10:11.610
The immortals from high above do not notice common folks like us.

10:14.440 --> 10:14.850
Eat it.

10:20.840 --> 10:21.850
Work for me from now on.

10:23.320 --> 10:24.370
Have you watched The Heavenly Peace Celebration?

10:25.080 --> 10:26.180
I will establish

10:26.910 --> 10:28.580
our very own safe haven in Changsha.

10:30.120 --> 10:30.820
So?

10:31.390 --> 10:32.530
Do you like your new outfit?

10:34.510 --> 10:35.340
Listen.

10:35.910 --> 10:38.010
From now on, you're my buddy.

10:38.720 --> 10:41.300
We just need a fortress now.

10:42.440 --> 10:42.940
Should we

10:43.550 --> 10:44.770
open a dog farm?

10:46.000 --> 10:47.820
We dug out money to buy new clothes.

10:48.510 --> 10:49.850
If you can get us a plot of land,

10:50.440 --> 10:51.220
I'll follow you

10:51.670 --> 10:52.340
and be loyal to you.

10:53.750 --> 10:54.370
Let me show you.

10:56.240 --> 10:58.420
I taught you how to sit down just now.

10:58.630 --> 10:59.820
Did you forget already?

11:00.360 --> 11:00.730
Again.

11:02.080 --> 11:02.460
Sit.

11:04.320 --> 11:04.650
Good boy.

11:04.910 --> 11:05.440
- You're back. - I'm hungry.

11:05.750 --> 11:06.180
I'm back.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.010
- Go and eat. - Okay.

11:10.200 --> 11:10.580
Laogou.

11:11.720 --> 11:12.370
Your food is here.

11:20.440 --> 11:21.580
We bought this dog farm

11:22.240 --> 11:23.530
a long time ago.

11:24.870 --> 11:26.460
How come we still don't have any customers?

11:28.480 --> 11:29.490
Running a business sure is tough.

11:29.960 --> 11:31.250
Perhaps

11:32.080 --> 11:33.420
no one knows

11:33.440 --> 11:34.530
what we're selling?

11:35.630 --> 11:36.820
Are you blind?

11:37.240 --> 11:38.610
Isn't it obvious?

11:39.550 --> 11:40.650
We sell guard dogs.

11:41.150 --> 11:42.770
You picked these dogs up from the street.

11:43.800 --> 11:44.930
They have not been trained.

11:47.760 --> 11:48.340
Right.

11:50.600 --> 11:52.300
Xiaozhu. Eat now.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.570
Once you're full, I need you to do a somersault.

11:54.960 --> 11:55.940
Do it 10,000 times per day.

11:56.880 --> 11:57.700
10,000 times.

11:57.750 --> 11:58.620
Don't laugh.

11:59.600 --> 12:00.690
You will learn how to throw a punch.

12:01.150 --> 12:02.170
Do it 10,000 times per day.

12:02.710 --> 12:03.650
10,000 times?

12:04.480 --> 12:06.300
You're supposed to tame the dogs, not me.

12:07.440 --> 12:08.420
Will 1,000 times do?

12:08.840 --> 12:10.730
You need to be strong.

12:11.600 --> 12:12.890
Like me.

12:14.320 --> 12:15.650
That way, no one will bully us.

12:15.870 --> 12:16.580
Listen.

12:18.120 --> 12:19.250
I have foreseen

12:19.910 --> 12:21.340
that our dog farm will be a huge deal.

12:22.080 --> 12:23.340
It will be successful soon.

12:23.750 --> 12:26.130
When we have more dogs and customers,

12:26.600 --> 12:28.730
our buns will have meat in them.

12:28.790 --> 12:30.460
As much meat as you want.

12:31.720 --> 12:33.700
Okay. I believe whatever you say.

12:33.700 --> 12:36.300
[Tongxing Boutique]

12:36.750 --> 12:38.220
Come back again.

12:41.670 --> 12:42.700
Careful, mister.

12:51.510 --> 12:53.130
You are what you wear.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.730
Getting an expensive outfit sure changes everything.

12:59.270 --> 13:00.180
Hi, sir.

13:02.030 --> 13:02.640
Sir.

13:02.900 --> 13:03.530
Sir.

13:03.530 --> 13:04.100
Sir.

13:04.440 --> 13:06.440
Sir, help us.

13:06.440 --> 13:07.700
Spare us some food.

13:08.120 --> 13:10.610
- My child hasn't eaten for three days. - Go away.

13:11.250 --> 13:13.360
Please spare us some food.

13:15.120 --> 13:16.010
Please.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.490
The world is unfair.

13:17.670 --> 13:18.890
The government doesn't care about us.

13:19.120 --> 13:21.060
- The gods don't care about us either. - Sir.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.420
Sir, please help us.

13:22.480 --> 13:23.130
Please.

13:23.150 --> 13:24.700
Sir, spare us some food.

13:24.840 --> 13:26.650
Please, sir.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.980
Please. Some food, please.

13:29.000 --> 13:29.490
Sir.

13:29.490 --> 13:30.550
Sir.

13:30.550 --> 13:31.340
Make some noodles for them.

13:32.200 --> 13:32.980
I'll pay for it.

13:34.600 --> 13:35.420
Thank you, sir.

13:35.750 --> 13:36.790
Thank you.

13:36.830 --> 13:38.550
- Thank you, sir. - Come with me after you eat.

13:39.120 --> 13:39.940
I'll find you a home.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.610
Thank you, sir.

13:42.000 --> 13:43.250
Thank you, sir.

13:44.270 --> 13:45.060
Thank you, sir.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.420
Useless Mystic Nine.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.340
Useless gods.

13:49.670 --> 13:50.580
I'll save

13:52.030 --> 13:52.980
those you don't save.

13:58.340 --> 13:59.320
[Former Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine]

13:59.320 --> 14:00.180
Hurry up.

14:00.480 --> 14:01.460
Trying to escape?

14:01.480 --> 14:02.180
Why are you hiding here?

14:02.200 --> 14:03.300
Escape again, I dare you.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.580
No. No.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.490
- Never escape again. - Work harder!

14:06.550 --> 14:07.250
Escape again, I dare you.

14:07.360 --> 14:07.980
Hurry up.

14:08.720 --> 14:09.250
I'll whip you to death.

14:09.870 --> 14:10.530
Never escape again.

14:33.630 --> 14:34.010
Run!

14:55.910 --> 14:57.340
You stupid dog breeders.

14:57.670 --> 14:58.890
Do you even know who I am?

14:58.960 --> 15:00.580
Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

15:00.910 --> 15:02.700
Release them and hand over their indentures.

15:03.480 --> 15:04.730
Then, I'll spare your life.

15:05.670 --> 15:07.180
Who do you think you are?

15:07.510 --> 15:09.100
Trying to cross the Mystic Nine?

15:09.270 --> 15:11.250
The Mystic Nine has been abusing their power.

15:11.870 --> 15:13.700
Is Master Zhang not going to do something about it?

15:13.960 --> 15:14.490
Master,

15:14.750 --> 15:16.220
their leader stays in their lofty palace.

15:16.440 --> 15:18.060
I heard the Mystic Nine has thousands of members.

15:18.480 --> 15:20.610
Zhang Qishan probably doesn't know about a trivial matter like this.

15:20.870 --> 15:23.370
Let's teach this guy a lesson on his behalf.

15:23.910 --> 15:24.850
Touch me if you dare.

15:25.120 --> 15:25.650
Master.

15:26.480 --> 15:28.460
The Mystic Nine also has a rule.

15:28.960 --> 15:30.700
Whoever defeats the leader of a clan

15:31.200 --> 15:32.580
gets to take over his position in the Mystic Nine.

15:32.720 --> 15:35.530
You think you can take over my position?

15:36.120 --> 15:36.850
Killing you

15:37.600 --> 15:39.610
will do justice to everyone else

15:40.030 --> 15:41.530
and earn me a solid reputation.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.530
What's the saying again?

15:43.750 --> 15:44.420
One chicken, two drumsticks?

15:44.910 --> 15:45.850
Two stones, one bird.

15:47.320 --> 15:48.700
You have a death wish!

15:52.060 --> 15:52.620
[Fifth]

15:54.380 --> 15:55.260
[Fifth]

15:58.500 --> 15:59.020
[Fifth]

15:59.100 --> 15:59.840
[Changsha Mystic Nine, Token]

15:59.840 --> 16:00.370
Master.

16:01.150 --> 16:02.820
You are now the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

16:04.200 --> 16:04.890
Congratulations, Master.

16:05.080 --> 16:05.850
Well done, Master.

16:06.320 --> 16:07.940
- Fifth Master! - Thank you for saving us.

16:08.030 --> 16:10.250
Thank you, Fifth Master.

16:10.320 --> 16:12.940
Thank you for saving us, Fifth Master.

16:12.960 --> 16:13.980
Thank you, Fifth Master.

16:13.980 --> 16:17.060
[Shared Legacy of the Mystic Nine]

16:53.600 --> 16:54.890
I am Wu Laogou.

16:55.600 --> 16:57.220
Owner of a dog farm.

16:58.030 --> 17:01.700
[Fifth]
I am now the Fifth Master.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.660
We have a new Fifth Master.

17:09.680 --> 17:11.860
Great. Master Zhang isn't here yet.

17:12.510 --> 17:14.730
So you can enjoy your seat for a while.

17:49.580 --> 17:50.810
Ever since,

17:51.030 --> 17:52.980
Wu Laogou ceased being Wu Laogou,

17:54.200 --> 17:56.330
and has become the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.250
His wish of seeing Master Zhang

18:00.480 --> 18:01.770
also came true.

18:44.070 --> 18:44.460
Master Zhang.

18:45.350 --> 18:45.810
Look.

18:46.830 --> 18:48.250
The baby sleeps so soundly

18:48.310 --> 18:49.490
in this god-forsaken place.

18:50.160 --> 18:51.530
Isn't that odd?

18:53.350 --> 18:54.180
It feels like

18:54.790 --> 18:56.730
this baby has been actively guiding us on this trip.

18:57.070 --> 18:58.620
It's almost as if someone is controlling the baby.

18:59.070 --> 18:59.700
What do you think?

19:01.110 --> 19:02.660
Don't be mad if I tell you my opinion.

19:02.880 --> 19:03.330
Just say it.

19:04.000 --> 19:06.330
This baby can sense the monster.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.980
It can also make expressions that only an adult can make.

19:09.440 --> 19:12.180
Perhaps he's not a baby at all?

19:12.550 --> 19:13.140
What do you mean?

19:17.030 --> 19:18.530
He's an adult.

19:20.350 --> 19:20.900
Impossible.

19:22.000 --> 19:22.620
Perhaps

19:22.640 --> 19:24.330
this baby has a special power.

19:24.680 --> 19:27.010
For instance, he can sense invisible monsters,

19:27.350 --> 19:28.220
and we can't.

19:28.480 --> 19:29.050
Master Zhang...

19:29.240 --> 19:31.330
You know I don't believe in magic.

19:31.590 --> 19:32.330
Don't be superstitious.

20:03.940 --> 20:05.340
[Shushen Hall]

20:09.510 --> 20:10.140
Xiaozhu?

20:11.070 --> 20:11.810
What are you doing here?

20:37.310 --> 20:38.090
Laogou?

20:50.640 --> 20:51.250
Girls!

20:52.460 --> 20:52.980
Miss Huo?

20:53.000 --> 20:54.770
Gather everyone. We're going to Xiangxi to save someone.

20:55.030 --> 20:55.700
Save someone?

20:56.920 --> 20:58.140
Where in Xiangxi is he?

20:58.960 --> 20:59.730
I'm not sure yet.

21:00.270 --> 21:01.490
Probably somewhere with a river.

21:01.960 --> 21:03.380
But there are many rivers in Xiangxi.

21:04.110 --> 21:04.940
We'll find out when we're there.

21:05.790 --> 21:06.810
But our clan barely settled down.

21:07.350 --> 21:08.330
There are many things to manage,

21:08.550 --> 21:09.660
and we lack manpower.

21:11.350 --> 21:13.010
Perhaps I'll ask for help from the Mystic Nine?

21:13.400 --> 21:14.860
Not many people trust me.

21:16.030 --> 21:16.940
I'll be found out

21:17.680 --> 21:18.900
regardless of who I send as my messenger.

21:20.510 --> 21:21.770
If the Japanese find out,

21:23.110 --> 21:24.220
things can be dire.

21:25.720 --> 21:27.460
What should we do, then?

21:29.640 --> 21:30.860
There's someone else I trust

21:31.030 --> 21:32.330
in the Mystic Nine.

21:32.960 --> 21:33.620
It seems like

21:35.680 --> 21:36.980
I have to visit Lunar Hotel

21:38.310 --> 21:39.380
in Beiping.

21:42.480 --> 21:43.050
Tiezui.

21:44.680 --> 21:45.380
What's on your mind?

21:47.590 --> 21:48.980
I'm worried about Stinky Yu.

21:50.030 --> 21:51.220
He's seriously injured.

21:51.750 --> 21:52.940
When is he going to make a full recovery?

21:53.350 --> 21:53.860
Besides,

21:54.440 --> 21:56.140
there are many wild animals in the mountains.

21:56.750 --> 21:58.220
Xiaojin is taking care of him alone.

21:59.070 --> 22:00.140
Will they be in danger?

22:00.920 --> 22:02.010
He's from my clan.

22:02.720 --> 22:03.940
Our blood is different.

22:04.270 --> 22:05.290
Wounds will heal faster.

22:05.720 --> 22:06.330
Don't worry about him.

22:08.590 --> 22:10.140
Oh. How could I forget about that?

22:10.590 --> 22:11.290
You're right.

22:13.680 --> 22:15.380
This isn't what you wanted to tell me, is it?

22:15.920 --> 22:17.770
You know me so well, Master Zhang.

22:19.160 --> 22:19.940
You see,

22:20.920 --> 22:24.140
what do you think would happen

22:25.070 --> 22:28.380
if Hatoyama took the risk to come back up here

22:28.680 --> 22:30.010
from the Otherworld Tower?

22:31.030 --> 22:32.420
Even with Ding Qiansui protecting him,

22:33.590 --> 22:34.980
will he be able to leave Changsha City?

22:36.400 --> 22:38.140
He won't be able to leave the city.

22:38.960 --> 22:40.250
When the Mystic Nine caught the spies,

22:41.070 --> 22:43.290
we sealed all the secret passages leading to the outside of the city.

22:43.480 --> 22:46.180
So, he can only take the underground river. Right?

22:50.030 --> 22:50.530
Carry on.

22:51.590 --> 22:53.010
Master Zhang, perhaps

22:53.750 --> 22:55.090
Hatoyama took the underground river

22:55.350 --> 22:56.620
to avoid the mountain deity,

22:56.920 --> 22:57.810
also known as Zhainiangniang.

22:58.550 --> 22:59.700
If they came up to the ground,

23:00.160 --> 23:01.700
they wouldn't be able to go past Mount Heimen.

23:01.790 --> 23:02.380
Avoid?

23:03.200 --> 23:04.490
Do you think the Japanese would do that?

23:05.270 --> 23:06.420
They strap grenades

23:06.480 --> 23:07.940
on someone and toss him

23:08.590 --> 23:09.860
to the mountain deity.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.180
Right.

23:14.590 --> 23:15.770
I believe they didn't come up to the ground

23:16.880 --> 23:18.140
not because it would be a difficult journey,

23:20.000 --> 23:21.180
but because they have no idea

23:21.200 --> 23:22.180
where they are heading.

23:23.440 --> 23:25.380
Only by following the underground river

23:25.830 --> 23:27.770
can they find the precise location.

23:29.510 --> 23:31.530
That makes sense, Master Zhang.

23:47.350 --> 23:47.810
Master Zhang.

23:48.550 --> 23:50.530
Hatoyama should be inside the mountain.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.620
Many unknown mountains

23:53.350 --> 23:55.050
lie behind Mount Heimen.

23:57.160 --> 23:58.010
So many mountains.

23:58.550 --> 23:59.330
Where should we start?

24:00.510 --> 24:01.490
We look for smoke during the day

24:02.000 --> 24:03.010
and wind during the night.

24:06.580 --> 24:10.680
[Several Days Later]

24:10.680 --> 24:11.090
Master.

24:12.070 --> 24:13.730
No traces of the Japanese here.

24:14.110 --> 24:15.620
And no entry found either.

24:16.480 --> 24:18.140
Master, I found nothing there either.

24:19.550 --> 24:20.620
This miasma forest

24:20.920 --> 24:22.010
is bigger than we expected.

24:22.590 --> 24:24.570
We're just scratching the surface.

24:24.960 --> 24:25.660
Should we continue?

24:26.070 --> 24:26.810
Continue.

24:27.270 --> 24:27.730
Yes.

24:38.350 --> 24:39.570
If Hatoyama has been here,

24:40.350 --> 24:41.420
he'll surely leave something behind.

24:44.260 --> 24:47.100
[Beiping]

24:47.180 --> 24:48.980
[Station Entrance]

24:56.660 --> 24:58.940
[Lunar Hotel]

25:01.190 --> 25:01.620
Thanks.

25:03.180 --> 25:06.420
[Lunar Hotel]

25:13.110 --> 25:14.010
A rare guest.

25:20.240 --> 25:20.940
Ms. Yin.

25:22.310 --> 25:24.570
Miss Huo, you came all the way to Beiping.

25:25.160 --> 25:27.010
Did something bad happen in Changsha?

25:29.480 --> 25:30.220
The Mystic Nine

25:30.240 --> 25:31.770
has undergone some changes

25:32.350 --> 25:33.330
due to Unit 401.

25:33.880 --> 25:35.530
I'm sure you're already aware of it.

25:36.540 --> 25:37.930
My husband did tell me about it.

25:39.200 --> 25:41.290
Laogou was kidnapped by the Japanese,

25:41.550 --> 25:42.730
and they went to Xiangxi to pursue him.

25:44.110 --> 25:44.810
I

25:44.830 --> 25:46.250
obtained important information in Changsha.

25:46.830 --> 25:47.460
However,

25:48.270 --> 25:49.700
I do not have the means to deliver it to Master Zhang.

25:50.750 --> 25:52.940
I came seeking your help.

25:53.350 --> 25:55.010
I wonder if you can reach Master Zhang

25:55.110 --> 25:56.490
and tell him to return to Changsha at once.

25:57.240 --> 25:58.660
What makes you think I can contact him?

25:59.400 --> 26:00.700
You're important to him.

26:01.070 --> 26:02.050
No matter where he is,

26:02.350 --> 26:04.290
he'll find a way to contact you.

26:05.110 --> 26:05.700
Besides,

26:06.480 --> 26:08.530
Master Zhang can ignore everyone's message,

26:09.200 --> 26:10.660
but never yours.

26:11.200 --> 26:11.900
Miss Huo,

26:12.550 --> 26:13.730
can I ask you something?

26:17.830 --> 26:19.530
What is

26:20.000 --> 26:21.220
Wu Laogou to you?

26:27.640 --> 26:28.420
We're lovers.

26:32.550 --> 26:34.770
I didn't expect honesty from you.

26:35.550 --> 26:36.770
I need a favor from you.

26:37.440 --> 26:39.460
Naturally, I have to be open and honest.

26:40.440 --> 26:42.250
You claimed to be open and honest.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.770
But here you are, asking me to tell my husband

26:44.830 --> 26:47.180
to give up on Wu Laogou and return to Changsha.

26:47.830 --> 26:49.460
You must have news of Laogou.

26:50.590 --> 26:51.810
Why can't you tell him right away?

26:52.680 --> 26:54.810
Because I have my reason, which I can't tell anyone.

26:56.680 --> 26:58.730
But if I can come here to seek your help,

26:59.200 --> 27:00.940
it means I have a plan.

27:01.920 --> 27:03.220
I will not put you

27:03.270 --> 27:04.380
or Master Zhang in danger.

27:05.680 --> 27:06.810
Here's the catch.

27:07.510 --> 27:09.140
I will only help you find my husband.

27:11.240 --> 27:11.900
Thank you.

27:27.340 --> 27:29.580
[Trove of all Treasures]

27:45.070 --> 27:46.530
I have found a way to escape.

27:47.240 --> 27:49.220
It is ingenious and dangerous at the same time.

27:50.440 --> 27:51.420
If you're reading this,

27:51.960 --> 27:53.140
please follow my instructions

27:53.480 --> 27:54.380
correctly.

27:55.270 --> 27:56.570
Otherwise, I'll die.

27:57.920 --> 27:59.050
It's okay if you don't want to take the risk.

28:00.240 --> 28:01.050
Walk your own path.

28:16.400 --> 28:16.930
Miss Huo.

28:20.720 --> 28:21.700
Are you lost?

28:23.310 --> 28:24.290
I am a friend of your master,

28:24.350 --> 28:25.380
Yin Xinyue.

28:25.720 --> 28:26.900
I just had a meal with her.

28:27.030 --> 28:28.380
I thought I could walk around a bit

28:28.550 --> 28:29.810
to sober up.

28:30.350 --> 28:31.770
You see, Miss Huo,

28:32.160 --> 28:33.940
this is the internal hall of Lunar Hotel.

28:34.270 --> 28:35.490
Many things here are confidential.

28:35.720 --> 28:36.700
No one can enter.

28:37.160 --> 28:37.940
Let me send you off.

28:38.920 --> 28:40.890
I heard the chief auctioneer of the internal hall

28:40.920 --> 28:42.770
oversees every auction in Lunar Hotel.

28:43.200 --> 28:44.380
He's good with math

28:44.680 --> 28:46.250
and possesses sharp business acumen.

28:47.160 --> 28:49.010
Can you bring me to him?

28:52.550 --> 28:54.490
I would like to pitch a sale to your chief auctioneer.

28:55.190 --> 28:56.760
A reliable source of mine

28:57.510 --> 28:59.640
told me that highly valuable ascended mummies

28:59.640 --> 29:01.290
will soon appear in Xiangxi.

29:01.790 --> 29:04.180
However, the mummies are located in a hidden, complex area.

29:04.590 --> 29:06.640
One can only find them if a huge investor like Lunar Hotel

29:06.640 --> 29:08.810
puts in the money and manpower.

29:09.160 --> 29:12.090
The mummies are of high quality.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.700
If you find them,

29:14.160 --> 29:15.290
you'll earn a fortune.

29:16.680 --> 29:18.140
I wonder if you've heard the rumor

29:18.200 --> 29:20.420
that the Huo Clan is laden with debts.

29:21.110 --> 29:22.050
The rumor is true.

29:22.680 --> 29:23.700
I came here today

29:24.160 --> 29:26.010
to save my clan.

29:27.350 --> 29:29.460
[10,000 yuan, Check]
These two checks prove my sincerity.

29:29.750 --> 29:31.620
You can keep it as collateral.

29:32.160 --> 29:33.660
If you find the ascended mummies

29:33.720 --> 29:34.620
using my information,

29:34.880 --> 29:36.140
you will have to pay me 10 times the amount.

29:36.640 --> 29:37.660
If you do not find the mummies,

29:39.030 --> 29:40.770
you can keep the checks.

29:42.440 --> 29:44.530
Miss Huo, you should leave.

29:52.830 --> 29:54.140
I'm new here.

29:54.550 --> 29:56.420
I do not know the rules in place.

29:57.790 --> 29:59.050
Forgive the insolence

29:59.830 --> 30:00.660
I displayed just now.

30:04.440 --> 30:05.140
Farewell.

30:07.030 --> 30:07.620
Wait.

30:11.580 --> 30:13.070
[Chief Auctioneer]

30:13.070 --> 30:15.290
Miss Huo, you came with such sincerity.

30:15.960 --> 30:18.770
We shouldn't disappoint you.

30:22.980 --> 30:25.420
[Two Weeks Later]

30:43.240 --> 30:44.700
You recovered so quickly.

30:45.440 --> 30:46.530
As expected of the Zhang Clan.

30:47.750 --> 30:48.090
Take this.

30:49.240 --> 30:49.570
Thanks.

30:50.510 --> 30:51.090
Well done.

30:52.310 --> 30:53.660
There, there.

30:57.030 --> 30:57.660
Master Zhang.

30:58.590 --> 31:00.050
It's been two weeks.

31:01.030 --> 31:02.010
This baby will be old enough

31:02.350 --> 31:04.180
to find a wife if we still don't find the Japanese.

31:07.350 --> 31:08.010
He's right.

31:08.680 --> 31:09.730
We know they are here,

31:09.960 --> 31:10.860
but we just can't find them.

31:11.830 --> 31:13.050
They don't start a fire during the day,

31:14.200 --> 31:15.220
and they don't put on lights either at night.

31:15.880 --> 31:16.700
How disciplined.

31:19.790 --> 31:20.660
If this carries on,

31:21.750 --> 31:22.810
we won't be able to find them.

31:24.160 --> 31:25.140
Then let's go down and find them.

31:25.920 --> 31:27.700
No. Our number is too small.

31:28.160 --> 31:29.380
If we assign one person to each mountain,

31:29.720 --> 31:31.420
it'll take at least three years to search this place.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.290
You know what, Master Zhang?

31:36.240 --> 31:37.530
Carry the baby for me.

31:42.160 --> 31:43.660
We'll lay a trap.

31:44.000 --> 31:44.860
We start a fire at night

31:45.310 --> 31:46.460
to invite them to ambush us.

31:48.830 --> 31:50.620
Hatoyama is a seasoned strategist.

31:51.030 --> 31:52.050
Do you think he'll fall for it?

31:54.160 --> 31:54.810
Right.

31:55.590 --> 31:56.620
What should we do now then?

31:57.270 --> 31:57.980
If this persists,

31:58.400 --> 31:59.940
Hatoyama's plan will come to fruition.

32:00.830 --> 32:01.860
Ask some to stay here.

32:02.310 --> 32:02.900
The rest will return to Changsha

32:03.920 --> 32:05.180
to dig the Otherworld Tower.

32:07.350 --> 32:08.530
We'll take the underground river?

32:10.590 --> 32:13.010
Despite Zhang Qishan's brilliant mind,

32:13.030 --> 32:16.010
the lead came to a dead end once again at Xiangxi.

32:16.270 --> 32:18.460
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's slyness

32:18.510 --> 32:21.860
left the Mystic Nine stumped.

32:22.070 --> 32:24.460
Unbeknownst to them,

32:24.640 --> 32:26.700
another plan

32:26.830 --> 32:28.770
is carefully unfolding under Wu Laogou's

32:28.920 --> 32:30.380
machinations.

32:30.550 --> 32:32.200
Xiangxi has a lot of rivers.

32:32.480 --> 32:34.110
Upon receiving the information from Huo Xiangu,

32:34.240 --> 32:36.980
Lunar Hotel's informants in Xiangxi

32:37.070 --> 32:38.570
bought 82 Stockade

32:38.640 --> 32:40.220
to investigate every river.

32:40.510 --> 32:43.810
Eventually, they found their treasure

32:44.480 --> 32:47.980
on a small branch of the Xijiang River.

32:49.830 --> 32:50.380
Bring it up.

33:06.400 --> 33:06.860
Open it.

33:12.270 --> 33:12.900
An ascended mummy!

33:15.240 --> 33:15.860
Bring it back.

33:16.110 --> 33:16.570
Yes.

33:22.830 --> 33:23.330
Master.

33:26.200 --> 33:26.860
An urgent telegram from Beiping.

33:28.960 --> 33:30.940
I've been having nightmares.

33:31.350 --> 33:33.380
I keep dreaming about a capsizing boat. It scares me.

33:36.920 --> 33:39.250
I want the osmanthus pastry in Changsha.

33:39.590 --> 33:40.220
Buy some for me.

33:40.590 --> 33:41.090
Master Zhang,

33:41.550 --> 33:44.140
did something happen to your wife?

33:44.400 --> 33:45.220
She's fine.

33:45.640 --> 33:46.530
It's a secret code.

33:48.350 --> 33:49.420
What does it mean then?

33:52.480 --> 33:54.140
She must have missed you so much.

33:54.160 --> 33:56.050
She said that something huge had happened,

33:56.790 --> 33:57.980
and that there was no point in staying here.

33:58.720 --> 33:59.490
She told me to head back to Changsha

33:59.790 --> 34:00.860
as the lead would come to me instead.

34:02.680 --> 34:03.980
How did she find out about all this?

34:04.960 --> 34:06.490
She wouldn't have used this method to contact me

34:07.160 --> 34:08.650
unless there was a huge discovery.

34:09.710 --> 34:10.780
It might be related to Laogou.

34:11.920 --> 34:13.740
Perhaps she used the secret code because the Ministry of War

34:14.000 --> 34:14.980
was monitoring closely.

34:16.070 --> 34:17.650
Let's do as she says and return now.

34:18.070 --> 34:19.050
You don't say.

34:19.280 --> 34:19.940
Return to Changsha.

34:22.020 --> 34:24.480
[Lunar Hotel]

34:24.480 --> 34:26.260
Seal both chests tight.

34:26.480 --> 34:27.340
Do not let air in.

34:27.920 --> 34:29.780
Otherwise, the things inside will decay very quickly.

35:03.030 --> 35:03.980
Send me a telegram to tell me you're safe.

35:04.440 --> 35:05.050
Otherwise,

35:05.320 --> 35:06.210
I'll cheat on you.

35:09.190 --> 35:10.170
Lunar Hotel has become

35:10.230 --> 35:11.650
a place of strife and competition.

35:12.070 --> 35:14.460
Huo Xiangu holds the information. See her immediately.

35:15.110 --> 35:15.650
Xiaojin.

35:17.840 --> 35:19.780
Send a telegram. 8273. To Beiping.

35:29.190 --> 35:30.260
I am home safely.

35:31.960 --> 35:32.820
Do not miss me too much.

35:35.070 --> 35:36.740
Things are still convoluted and dangerous.

35:37.840 --> 35:40.380
I will let you know if there's any update.

35:41.630 --> 35:42.010
Yes.

35:44.920 --> 35:45.570
Is she here?

35:47.190 --> 35:47.690
Yes.

35:48.030 --> 35:49.820
She has been waiting for you in the back hall. She also said

35:50.230 --> 35:50.820
that you

35:51.230 --> 35:52.090
should see her when you arrive.

35:58.630 --> 35:59.690
Master Zhang, I'm surprised

35:59.880 --> 36:01.650
that you actually rushed back upon receiving the telegram.

36:02.480 --> 36:03.460
I trust

36:04.280 --> 36:05.420
you never joke around when it comes to Laogou.

36:05.920 --> 36:06.740
Did you find him?

36:07.920 --> 36:08.570
Too few leads.

36:09.550 --> 36:10.490
Same here.

36:13.150 --> 36:14.940
These are new items coming next month in Lunar Hotel's auction.

36:15.360 --> 36:16.940
In his message, Laogou mentioned

36:17.030 --> 36:17.980
these two chests.

36:18.800 --> 36:20.010
Did he say where he was

36:20.440 --> 36:21.090
and how to save him?

36:22.670 --> 36:23.210
No, he did not.

36:29.190 --> 36:30.610
Laogou said those two chests

36:30.630 --> 36:31.740
were the key to finding him.

36:32.230 --> 36:33.940
I made it so that the Lunar Hotel secured the chests.

36:34.440 --> 36:35.860
But I can't do much about the rest.

36:36.280 --> 36:37.740
Master Zhang, I hope you can do your best

36:37.880 --> 36:38.860
to win the bid for the chests.

36:39.590 --> 36:40.740
That way, the truth

36:41.670 --> 36:42.610
will surface.

36:45.590 --> 36:47.090
The Lunar Hotel is unique in the sense

36:47.320 --> 36:48.740
that it houses every precious item in the world.

36:49.590 --> 36:50.780
No one is guaranteed

36:51.230 --> 36:53.050
to get what they want in the auction.

36:53.510 --> 36:54.170
But you

36:54.920 --> 36:56.210
are the owner's son-in-law.

36:56.510 --> 36:58.340
I'm sure this won't be too difficult

36:59.510 --> 37:00.340
for you.

37:01.800 --> 37:02.610
I'm counting on you, Master Zhang.

37:09.840 --> 37:11.420
Given my relationship with Laogou,

37:12.070 --> 37:13.740
I should come with you.

37:14.360 --> 37:16.340
But my clan has undergone a lot of changes.

37:16.960 --> 37:18.530
I have a lot on my plate.

37:21.030 --> 37:22.420
So, I shall not burden you further.

37:23.000 --> 37:23.980
Do you need help?

37:31.320 --> 37:33.090
Xiangu, you went to Beiping without telling us.

37:33.590 --> 37:35.300
Why can't we maintain open communication with each other?

37:38.710 --> 37:40.490
We are familiar with the Lunar Hotel.

37:43.000 --> 37:45.210
Coincidentally, these antiques

37:45.480 --> 37:46.940
require appraisal from a professional

37:47.320 --> 37:48.380
before we can trust them.

37:48.550 --> 37:50.980
Therefore, I'd like to invite you

37:52.230 --> 37:54.090
to come to the auction with us.

37:57.110 --> 37:58.050
How come

37:58.590 --> 37:59.900
you're so interested in the places I've been?

38:00.230 --> 38:02.010
Your sudden visit to the Lunar Hotel

38:02.920 --> 38:04.490
might be closely connected

38:04.960 --> 38:05.940
to another incident

38:06.230 --> 38:07.650
we encountered.

38:07.800 --> 38:08.820
Spare me the details.

38:09.280 --> 38:10.300
I do not want to know everything.

38:11.670 --> 38:13.010
If it has nothing to do with you,

38:13.190 --> 38:15.340
what's stopping you from joining us?

38:15.760 --> 38:16.570
In Beiping,

38:17.480 --> 38:20.010
Lunar Hotel is not an ordinary auction hall.

38:20.800 --> 38:21.820
What's in it for me

38:22.880 --> 38:24.130
if I come with you?

38:24.880 --> 38:25.650
I promise you

38:26.960 --> 38:28.380
that your ailment

38:31.030 --> 38:32.610
will be cured.

38:34.880 --> 38:35.780
Find Laogou.

38:36.960 --> 38:37.940
I can handle

38:39.230 --> 38:40.130
the rest.

38:46.000 --> 38:46.530
Guards.

38:47.190 --> 38:48.090
Bring Eighth Master over.

38:50.060 --> 38:53.780
[Beiping City's Latest Map]

38:55.590 --> 38:56.090
Master Zhang,

38:57.110 --> 38:58.010
you've been studying it for a while.

38:58.510 --> 38:59.740
Take a break and eat something.

39:00.590 --> 39:01.740
You're so carefree, Eighth Master.

39:02.150 --> 39:02.940
You still have a good appetite.

39:03.760 --> 39:05.300
Fill your stomach first.

39:05.760 --> 39:07.260
There is still hope now.

39:07.670 --> 39:08.860
If we fall here, how are we supposed

39:09.400 --> 39:10.260
to save Laogou?

39:12.280 --> 39:13.650
Auction Item No. 038 and 039

39:14.150 --> 39:15.820
in the Lunar Hotel.

39:16.440 --> 39:17.300
They are

39:17.960 --> 39:19.650
two chests containing ascended mummies.

39:20.400 --> 39:21.380
Tiezui, check

39:22.230 --> 39:23.900
if they came from Xiangxi.

39:23.900 --> 39:25.380
[Artifact Chest]

39:27.550 --> 39:28.210
Yes, they are.

39:30.070 --> 39:31.380
Laogou wrote to Xiangu

39:32.110 --> 39:33.740
telling her that the artifact chests led to him.

39:34.070 --> 39:36.090
Therefore, we must win the bid for the chests.

39:38.030 --> 39:39.300
He wrote to Xiangu?

39:41.550 --> 39:42.170
Right.

39:43.000 --> 39:44.090
Both of them

39:44.670 --> 39:46.570
should share a way of communicating.

39:47.230 --> 39:48.260
Every rich man in this nation

39:49.110 --> 39:50.900
has now gathered in Beiping.

39:52.070 --> 39:53.010
On the eve of battle,

39:54.550 --> 39:56.490
they want to turn liquidity into antiques

39:57.030 --> 39:59.210
before transferring them abroad.

40:00.110 --> 40:01.210
They will achieve this at all costs.

40:01.960 --> 40:03.210
Even if we combine all our assets in the Mystic Nine,

40:03.840 --> 40:04.900
we probably will lose the bid.

40:06.590 --> 40:07.090
Master Zhang,

40:07.760 --> 40:09.650
aren't you the son-in-law of Lunar Hotel?

40:10.440 --> 40:12.690
Lunar Hotel was established 300 years ago.

40:13.480 --> 40:14.820
Their rules have never been broken before.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.820
A son-in-law is replaceable.

40:18.280 --> 40:20.530
Their reputation is the foundation of their success.

40:22.800 --> 40:25.380
Then, we need to prepare enough money.

40:28.840 --> 40:30.940
You still haven't paid me back for the blanket bid I made back then.

40:31.670 --> 40:33.900
Even if we were as rich as before,

40:34.070 --> 40:35.170
we still wouldn't win the bid.

40:36.960 --> 40:37.900
I see, Master Zhang.

40:38.320 --> 40:40.650
Let me buy some joss paper

40:41.000 --> 40:41.980
and burn it for Laogou.

40:42.630 --> 40:45.130
May he rest in peace.

40:45.840 --> 40:48.010
Today will be his death anniversary.

40:48.280 --> 40:49.170
What do you think?

40:50.510 --> 40:52.530
So, instead of bidding for it

40:53.670 --> 40:55.260
in the Lunar Hotel,

40:56.150 --> 40:57.260
we steal it.

40:57.360 --> 40:58.170
Steal it?

40:59.150 --> 41:01.010
The most expensive antiques are,

41:01.150 --> 41:01.980
without exception,

41:02.230 --> 41:04.090
auctioned in the Lunar Hotel.

41:05.510 --> 41:07.780
The influence of the Lunar Hotel runs deep.

41:08.710 --> 41:10.940
Their rules must be respected, whether you're a law-abiding citizen

41:11.230 --> 41:12.300
or a gangster.

41:13.150 --> 41:16.090
In this trip, other than the other buyers,

41:16.840 --> 41:19.170
we must guard against ear slaves

41:20.070 --> 41:20.860
and pole slaves.

41:24.230 --> 41:25.210
Ear slaves have good hearing.

41:26.000 --> 41:28.010
They can pick up any noise within a 100-meter radius.

41:28.760 --> 41:30.340
Anything that happens during the auction

41:30.670 --> 41:32.010
will not escape their ears.

41:33.070 --> 41:34.260
Pole slaves are masters of polearms.

41:34.880 --> 41:36.300
Their polearms contain poisonous needles.

41:36.710 --> 41:38.690
They can kill someone from a great distance.

41:39.550 --> 41:40.780
If a rabble-rouser runs into a pole slave

41:40.800 --> 41:41.570
in the Lunar Hotel,

41:41.960 --> 41:44.170
they will die within five steps.

41:45.480 --> 41:47.050
The latest auction in the Lunar Hotel

41:47.710 --> 41:48.940
has also turned underground.

41:49.590 --> 41:50.530
[Lunar Hotel]
There is a new rule.

41:51.070 --> 41:52.650
Before the hour of Xu, it's the morning session.

41:52.840 --> 41:54.300
After the hour of Xu, it's the evening session.

41:55.230 --> 41:57.010
You need to win the bid for three items in the morning session

41:57.480 --> 41:58.650
to join the evening session.

41:59.480 --> 42:01.050
During the auction,

42:01.510 --> 42:03.090
you can sit individually or in a private cabin.

42:03.710 --> 42:04.900
Those in the private cabin can make a blanket bid.

42:05.670 --> 42:07.170
Those two items that Laogou wants us to bid

42:07.880 --> 42:09.740
will surely appear in the evening session.

42:11.440 --> 42:12.610
Thus, our mission is

42:13.710 --> 42:14.300
firstly,

42:14.760 --> 42:15.650
win the bid

42:16.320 --> 42:17.490
of three items in the morning session

42:17.510 --> 42:18.260
to enter the evening session.

42:18.880 --> 42:19.380
Secondly,

42:20.000 --> 42:20.860
we will secure a private cabin

42:21.880 --> 42:22.820
in the evening session.

42:23.740 --> 42:25.260
[Beiping City's Latest Map]

42:29.370 --> 42:31.270
How can we secure a private cabin, then?

42:32.230 --> 42:34.460
There are so many rich people in Beiping now.

42:34.920 --> 42:36.570
Even if we pool the wealth of the Mystic Nine,

42:36.920 --> 42:37.570
we will probably

42:37.590 --> 42:39.010
be given individual seats.

42:39.440 --> 42:40.860
That's embarrassing, Master Zhang.

42:42.920 --> 42:44.260
It's easy to secure a private cabin.

42:44.920 --> 42:45.820
You just need money.

42:46.510 --> 42:47.460
With enough money,

42:48.070 --> 42:48.940
you can enter a private cabin.

42:50.760 --> 42:51.380
I see.

42:52.070 --> 42:54.650
You want us to raise funds

42:55.000 --> 42:56.130
for you to sit alone in the cabin.

42:56.510 --> 42:57.300
The rest will sit on individual seats.

42:57.510 --> 42:57.980
No.

42:58.760 --> 43:00.300
One private cabin can accommodate two people.

43:01.030 --> 43:02.650
We need two private cabins at least.

43:03.000 --> 43:05.420
One to hype the scene

43:05.670 --> 43:06.780
and draw the attention of the ear slaves.

43:07.030 --> 43:08.050
The other cabin to...

43:08.150 --> 43:08.690
To steal

43:09.000 --> 43:09.690
the chests

43:10.190 --> 43:10.940
and kidnap your father-in-law.

43:11.590 --> 43:13.240
Do whatever we can to get the chests

43:13.280 --> 43:15.210
and restore your bachelor status.

43:24.630 --> 43:26.170
Who is the richest in the Mystic Nine?

43:27.280 --> 43:28.380
Xie Jiu.

43:30.360 --> 43:31.460
Isn't the case he's dealing with now

43:31.710 --> 43:33.050
the consequences of what he did

43:33.190 --> 43:34.570
when he helped you in the Lunar Hotel?

43:36.880 --> 43:39.050
And he shall solve it where it began.

43:40.000 --> 43:40.780
Gather our accounts

43:41.320 --> 43:42.130
and bring

43:42.550 --> 43:43.650
all of your money.

43:44.480 --> 43:45.740
Master Zhang, I have no money.

43:46.480 --> 43:48.010
I was already penniless last time.

43:51.280 --> 43:52.340
Xiangu won't join us

43:52.960 --> 43:54.130
in Beiping.

43:55.110 --> 43:56.650
Just the three of us won't make the cut.

43:57.630 --> 43:58.380
We need

43:59.280 --> 44:00.820
two more people on top of Xie Jiu.

44:01.230 --> 44:02.090
Two more people?

44:03.110 --> 44:04.820
I'll handle Xie Jiu.

44:05.510 --> 44:06.530
Find the rest yourself.

44:08.150 --> 44:08.490
Master Zhang.

44:09.550 --> 44:10.740
This will be challenging.

44:11.360 --> 44:12.740
While the meeting we had last time

44:12.760 --> 44:14.380
seems to suggest that there is unity among us,

44:14.550 --> 44:16.010
but we all know

44:16.230 --> 44:17.460
that we each have a mess to clean up.

44:18.110 --> 44:19.740
Our subordinates have long-standing feuds,

44:20.150 --> 44:22.050
and now you want him to help you?

44:23.030 --> 44:24.170
That's a tall order.

44:29.230 --> 44:30.170
I believe the Mystic Nine

44:31.590 --> 44:32.780
knows what the right thing to do is.

44:51.260 --> 44:55.420
♪The past fades like smoke♪

44:55.780 --> 44:58.500
♪A choice is made in silence♪

44:58.780 --> 45:01.580
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

45:01.980 --> 45:05.740
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

45:05.980 --> 45:09.420
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

45:09.700 --> 45:13.100
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

45:13.180 --> 45:20.460
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

45:20.900 --> 45:24.180
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

45:24.460 --> 45:27.700
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

45:27.860 --> 45:31.900
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

45:32.100 --> 45:35.460
♪Who believes in fate?♪

45:35.700 --> 45:39.060
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

45:39.300 --> 45:42.580
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

45:42.900 --> 45:46.580
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

45:46.780 --> 45:50.020
♪Take care♪

45:50.020 --> 45:52.580
♪We once raced♪

45:52.660 --> 45:54.580
♪For the dawn♪

45:54.740 --> 45:58.020
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

45:58.140 --> 46:01.420
♪In the web of fate♪

46:01.420 --> 46:04.620
♪No one can escape♪

46:05.620 --> 46:07.460
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

46:07.620 --> 46:09.180
♪We too were young once♪

46:09.260 --> 46:12.700
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

46:12.900 --> 46:15.220
♪Keep the ember lit♪

46:15.340 --> 46:19.860
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

46:19.980 --> 46:22.940
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

46:23.180 --> 46:26.700
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

46:26.820 --> 46:30.580
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

46:30.900 --> 46:34.380
♪Who believes in fate?♪

46:34.540 --> 46:37.540
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

46:37.780 --> 46:41.540
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

46:41.700 --> 46:45.420
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

46:45.540 --> 46:56.980
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
